  -- lines 486-496 raw render --
   486| real, the test is green over it, and the exit status is 1.
   487|   How a row is run
   488| 
   489|   prepare <dir>  is called  once  to build a pristine copy of the tree. The working tree is
   490| never mutated; a prepare that points outside its directory is refused. A row whose old
   491| literal occurs more than once in its target there is refused: the rewrite takes the first
   492| copy, which might not be the one the row means.
   493|  Every distinct selector is run once, uninjected, and must come back green ( baseline ). With
   494|  SHMUTANT_COUNTS=1  the whole suite also runs once, unselected, and each selection must count,
   495| per unit, the assertions the whole suite counts ( docs/integrating.md
   496| section 3).
